  <refsect1>
    <title>Description</title>

    <para><interfacename>io.systemd.SysUpdate.Notify</interfacename> is a Varlink interface implemented by
    <citerefentry><refentrytitle>systemd</refentrytitle><manvolnum>1</manvolnum></citerefentry>-related
    components. It can be introspected and called with
    <citerefentry><refentrytitle>varlinkctl</refentrytitle><manvolnum>1</manvolnum></citerefentry>.</para>


  </refsect1>

  <refsect1>
    <title>Interface Definition</title>

    <para>The following interface definition is exposed:</para>

    <programlisting varlink-interface="io.systemd.SysUpdate.Notify">
interface io.systemd.SysUpdate.Notify

type Resource(
	transfer: string,
	path: ?string
)

method OnCompletedUpdate(
	component: ?string,
	version: ?string,
	resources: ?[]Resource
) -&gt; ()
</programlisting>

