    </refsect1>

  <refsect1>
    <title>Examples</title>

    <para><screen>varlinkctl introspect <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable> io.systemd.SysUpdate.Notify</screen> shows the
    interface definition as served by <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable>, and
    <screen>varlinkctl call <replaceable>SERVICE</replaceable> io.systemd.SysUpdate.Notify.OnCompletedUpdate '{}'</screen>
